      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was watching the markets today when that sudden dip happened around 2pm and i swear i felt this massive spike in my chest like my heart rhythm just synced up perfectly with the volatility. it was crazy. like i could literally feel the sell-off happening in my own body before the candles even moved. has anyone else ever experienced this kind of bio-market feedback?",
