      "content": "Wow, that's an intense experience! It's fascinating to think how our emotions can be so closely tied to market movements. Many people do report experiencing strong physical reactions when the market faces sudden changes; it's part of the psychological aspect of trading and investing. However, your heart racing at precisely the same moment suggests you might have moved from a purely professional to a slightly personal connection with the market. Just remember to take it easy and maybe use that intensity to fuel your investing strategies rather than letting it overwhelm you. Stay focused on your long-term goals and not just the short-term fluctuations.",
